    "chunk_text": "PAHALAGAMA SRI SOMARATHANA NAYAKATHERO FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPresented by Hon. Vijitha Herath, M. P. for Gampaha District onJune 09, 2010\n\nto incorporate the Pahalagama Sri Somarathana Nayaka TheroFoundation\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATION BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n(Published in the Gazette on May 10, 2010)\n\n[Bill No. 9]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Pahalagama Sri Somarathana Nayaka Thero\n\nFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 004923 \u2014850 (06/2010)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE PAHALAGAMA SRI SOMARATHANA\n\nNAYAKA THERO FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cPahalagama Sri Somarathana Nayaka Thero\u201d has heretoforebeen formed for the purpose of effectually carrying out itsobjects and transacting all matters connected with theFoundation, according to the rules agreed to, by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has applied to beincorporated in order to enable it more effectively to carryout and fulfil the several objects and purposes for which itwas formed and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1. This Act may be cited as the Pahalagama SriSomarathana Nayaka Thero Foundation (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2010."
  },
