    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of June 18, 2010\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 21. 06. 2010)\n\nDESHAMANYA RAVINDRA WANIGASEKARAFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Deshamanya Ravindra Wanigasekara Foundation\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Dayasiri Jayasekara, M. P. forKurunegala District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Deshamanya Ravindra Wanigasekara Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nShort title.\n\n30\n\nPreamble.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE DESHAMANYA RAVINDRAWANIGASEKARA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Organisation called and known as the\u201cDeshamanya Ravindra Wanigasekara Foundation\u201d has beenestablished in Sri Lanka, for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and matters connectedwith the said Organisation according to the rules agreed toby its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Organisation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted several objects andmatters for which it was established and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Deshamanya RavindraWanigasekara Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2010"
