    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as Follows :\u2014\n\n1.This act may be cited as the Samadhi CommunityDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act No. of 2010\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to organize maintain and uplift the educationalactivities and pre training programmes for the poorchildren and young those who have no educationalfacilities;\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof theSamadhicommunityDevelopmentFoundation.\n\nShort title.\n\nSamadhi Community Development Foundation\n\n(Incorporation)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(b)to utilize the youth labour for the welfare of thegeneral public;\n\n(c)to encourage the farmers and establish youngfarmers organisations;\n\n(d)to grant opportunities for training in pre-vocationaleducation, in the fields of sports, computer training,massmedia, leadership, learning of Tamil, Englishand other Languages;\n\n(e)to conduct lectures, seminars, exhibitions and toorganise educational propaganda activities;\n\n(f)to establish library facilities;\n\n(g)to preservation of environment and comparativedevelopment ; and\n\n(h)to do all such other acts, matters and things as areincidental or conductive to the attainment of theobjectives of the corporation."
