    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nKUDABUTHGAMUWA SRI PIYADASSINARAMAVIHARASTHANA PERFORMANCE SOCIETY(INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 62]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. (Mrs.) Sriyani Wijewickrama M. P. forDigamadulla District on January 05, 2011\n\n(Published in the Gazette on December 06, 2010)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nto incorporate the Kudabuthgamuwa Sri Piyadassinarama Viharasthana\n\nPerformance Society\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n1Kudabuthgamuwa Sri PiyadassinaramaViharasthana Performance Society (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 005423\u2014850 (01/2011)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE KUDABUTHGAMUWA SRIPIYADASSINARAMA VIHARASTHANA PERFORMANCE SOCIETY(INCORPORATION)\n\nWHEREAS a Society called and known as the\u201cKudabuthgamuwa Sri Piyadassinarama ViharasthanaPerformance Society\u201d has heretofore been formed for thepurpose of effectually carrying out it\u2019s object and transactingall matters concerned with the said Society according to therules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Society has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was formed and has applied to be incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kudabuthgamuwa SriPiyadassinarama Viharasthana Performance Society(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2011."
  },
