    "chunk_size_bytes": 1931,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Maithripala SenanayakeFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2011.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) social development associations namely LankaLakshmi Kantha Sanvidanaya and Senuri Minuri\n\n2\u2014PL 005406\u201480 (12/2010)\n\nPreamble.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15Short title.\n\nIncorporationof theMaithripalaSenanayakeFoundation.20\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n25\n\n30\n\nMaithripala Senanayake Foundation (Incorporation)2\n\nFoundation will be affiliated to the MaithripalaSenanayake Foundation;\n\n(b) organizing and conducting educational workshopsand programmes essential for students to improvetheir knowledge and perception as well as skillswithin the educational sector of Sri Lanka, creatingscholarship programmes up to university educationfor students with exceptional talents and grantingthem with gifts, certificates and other awards andextending assistance to improve Dhamma Schoolsand pre-schools;\n\n(c) contributing and encouraging promotion ofreligious and cultural activities related toBuddhism, Hinduism, Catholicism and Islam asmuch as possible, while working to establish mutualunderstanding, trust and unity among peoplebelonging to all faiths;\n\n(d) educating the people living in urban, rural and inestate regions on basic hygenic requirements andorganizing programs to create awareness of thevirtues of preserving the natural environment whileproviding facilities as much as possible to preservethe environment and to enable a healthy life pattern;\n\n(e) organizing and conducting programmes forempowering deprived families while minimizingpoverty and introducing self employmentgenerating projects while helping sickly personsin low income families and assisting during specialevents in those families such as funerals andweddings;"
  },
