    "chunk_text": "5.(1) The Management of the affairs of the Corporationsubject to the other provisions of this Act and the rules inforce for the time being of the Corporation be administeredby a Management Board consisting of Chairperson Secretary,Treasurer, Assistant Secretary, Vice Chairperson, Organizerand the Chairperson of the Advisory Board.\n\nGeneralPowers oftheCorporation.\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\nMaithripala Senanayake Foundation (Incorporation)5\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n(3) Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in thesubsection (1) of this Article, Hon. Tissa WijayarethneKaralliyadda, M. P., presently residing at \u201cSiri Medura\u201d,Kiulekada, Kebithigollewa who is the founder of theFoundation shall be the Chairperson of this Corporation forlife. If he has not appointed a successor, the Board of Directorsshall appoint a person for it.\n\n(4) The first Management Board of the Corporation shallconsist of the members who had been the office-bearers ofthe Maithripala Senanayake Foundation holding office onthe day preceding the date of commencement of this Act.\n\n6.The Corporation consists of an Advisory Board. Themembers of the Advisory Board may participate in themeetings of the Management Board and in general meetings.This Board may provide guidance to the advancement ofthe Corporation while it may present its views in the abovegatherings. However, Advisory Board has no power to moveproposals or vote to second proposals.\n\n7.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, at any generalmeeting and by a majority of two-thirds of the memberspresent and voting to make rules from time to time, notinconsistent with the provisions of this Act, and other writtenlaw, for all or any of the following matters :\u2014\n\n(a)subscription to be paid by the members, theiradmission, expulsion and resignations;\n\n(b)election of the Management Board, vacation of, orremoval from office as office bearers and powers,duties and conduct of the Management Board;"
