    "chunk_text": "(g)to appoint, employ, transter and dismiss officers andservants required for realizing the objects of theCorporation and to maintain disciplinary controlover them and to stipulate terms and conditionsregards their service ;\n\n10\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nGeneralPowers of theCorporation.\n\nHeadang Education Foundation(Incorporation)4\n\n5.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subjects tothe rules in force for the time being of the Corporation beadministered by an Executive Committee consisting of notmore than nine members as may be provided for in such rulesand consisting of the Chief Consultant, two Chairmen,Administrative Director, Managing Director, Treasurer, threemembers of the Board of Directors.\n\n(2) The first Board of Management of the Corporationshall consist of the members holding office in the Foundationon the day immidiately preceding the date of commencementof this Act.\n\n6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation to make ruleswith regard to all or any of the following matters from time totime, at any General Meeting of the Corporation and by amajority of not less than two-thirds of the members presentand voting to make such rules, as are not inconsistent withthe provisions of this Act or any other written law :\u2014\n\n(a) the election, appointment or nomination of membersof the Board of Management, their powers, functionsand their term of office ;\n\n(b) the powers, conduct, role and functions of variousofficers, agents and servants of the Corporation ;\n\n(c) the procedure to be adopted in convening andholding the meetings of the Corporation and theBoard of Management, the time, venue, notices,agenda, quorum and the general conduct of suchmeetings ;\n\n(d) qualifications and disqualifications for themembership of the Board of Management of theCorporation ;\n\n10\n\n5\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n5Headang Education Foundation(Incorporation)"
