    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cD. M. DassanayakeSocial Services and Charity Foundation\u201d (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2011.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be as follows\u2014\n\n(a)to nurture the people through development requiredfor eliminating poverty of the Sri Lankan people;\n\nIncorporationof the D. M.DassanayakeSocialServices andCharityFoundation.\n\nD. M. Dassanayake Social Services andCharity Foundation (Incorporation)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to guide people towards a tranquil life byminimizing restlessness in them by promotingconsolatory teaching for mental and emotionalstrains encountered by the human kind;\n\n(c)to redeem the Sri Lankan people from pettydifferences by promoting cooperation andco-existence through the realization of clearknowledge of life gained through Buddhism forpersons of any age whether they be juvenile, youngor elderly;\n\n(d)to convert the family and society to a self-reliantunit, identifying the social personality which ishelpful for a virtuous society devoid of racial andreligious differences;\n\n(e)to make maximum contribution for thedevelopment of personality of poverty-strickenchildren by offering financial and physicalprovisions for their physical and mentaldevelopment;\n\n(f)to provide theoretical and practical knowledge tonecessary personnel for the effective maintainingof agricultural and economic strategies;\n\n(g)to promote physical and human resources requiredfor steering the children receiving school educationfor the guidance and additional support of SriLankan academics with the aim of developing theirliteracy and helping them to face publicexaminations;\n\n(h)to assist to develop a good economic condition inthe family by providing the required vocationaltraining, physical and financial resources for youngpeople interested in self employment;\n\n30"
