    "chunk_size_bytes": 2024,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Madahapola SriRatnapalaramaya Religious and Buddhist EducationalDevelopment Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2011.\n\nIncorporationofMadahapolaSriRatnapalaramayaReligious andBuddhistEducationalFoundation.\n\n2Madahapola Sri Ratnapalaramaya Religiousand Buddhist Educational DevelopmentFoundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n3.The general objects for which Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014\n\n(a)protect and nourish Buddhism, safeguard the rightsof Buddhists, Protect the spiritual, educational,cultural and social rights of Buddhists;\n\n(b)bring about moral and economic progress of thesociety through quantitative and qualitativedevelopment of Buddhist Bhikkus in historicalYapahuwa area;\n\n(c)draw advisory and financial support fromCenters of Bhikku Organizations, GovernmentInstitutions, Non-Governmental Organizations,Sasana Development Fund of the Dalada Maligawa,the Sri Siddartha Saranankara Welfare Foundationof Malwathu Viharaya and foreign embassies;\n\n(d)lay the foundation for a long term program forreligious development by establishing a fund andincorporating it;\n\n(e)construct a building complex with residentialfacilities for about 100 Bhikkus, endowed withcapabilities for the development of religiousactivities, modern communication skills andproficiency in languages;\n\n(f)drawing the attention of relevant authorities to theneed to pave the way for a life style based onrighteous employment in a hydraulic civilization;\n\n(g)provide facilities for the temples to serve the publicbased on the concept \u2018from temple to the peoplerather than from people to the temple\u2019;\n\n(h)take necessary steps to lead the youth on righteouspaths by moving them away from misdirected paths;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Madahapola Sri Ratnapalaramaya Religiousand Buddhist Educational DevelopmentFoundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
  },
