    "chunk_text": "(h)take necessary steps to lead the youth on righteouspaths by moving them away from misdirected paths;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Madahapola Sri Ratnapalaramaya Religiousand Buddhist Educational DevelopmentFoundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(i)take action to eradicate the addiction to drugs whichis a social menace;\n\n(j)motivate the people to commence pre-schools intemple premises and implement programs tomotivate children to lead a religious life;\n\n(k)take necessary steps to commence Damma Schoolsin temples where Damma Schools are notconducted;\n\n4.Subject to provisions of this Act and any other writtenlaw the corporation shall have the power to do, perform andexecute all such acts, matters and things whatsoever, as arenecessary or desirable for the promotion or furtherance ofthe objects of the Corporation or any one of them, includingpower to open, operate and close bank accounts, borrow orraise moneys with or without security, to accept and orcollect grants and donations, to invest the corporations fundsand to engage, employ and dismiss officers and servantsrequired or suitable for promotion and carrying out all of orany one of the objects of the Corporation.\n\n5.The affairs of the corporation shall be managed by aBoard of Management selected subject to and in accordancewith the regulations of the Board.\n\n6.The officers who held office in the Madahapola SriRatnapalaramaya Religious and Buddhist EducationalDevelopment Foundation on the day preceding the date ofthe commencement of this Act shall continue to hold officein the Corporation under the regulations of this Act and thepersons who were members on that date will continue to bemembers subject to the regulations of this Corporation.\n\n7.It shall be lawful for Corporation from time to time atany general meeting by majority of votes of not less thantwo thirds of the members present and voting to make such\n\nManagementof theactivities oftheCorporation."
