    "chunk_text": "7.It shall be lawful for Corporation from time to time atany general meeting by majority of votes of not less thantwo thirds of the members present and voting to make such\n\nManagementof theactivities oftheCorporation.\n\nGeneralpowers of theCorporation.\n\n4Madahapola Sri Ratnapalaramaya Religiousand Buddhist Educational DevelopmentFoundation(Incorporation)\n\nrules as are not inconsistent with the provisions of this Actor any other written law for the purpose of admission,resignation and expulsion of members, procedure to beobserved in the transaction of the business of the Corporationand general administration or in pursuit of the objects ofCorporation by the representatives, employees or theDirectorate.\n\nRules so made can be amended or rescinded in the samemanner they were made at a similar meeting.\n\n8.The members of the corporation shall be subjected tothe rules of the Corporation.\n\n9.The corporation shall be able and capable in law toacquire and hold any property, movable or immovable, whichmay become vested in by virtue of any purchase, grant, giftand testamentary disposition or otherwise and all suchproperty shall be held by the Corporation for the purpose ofthe Corporation and subject to rules of this Act andprovisions of the Corporation with full power to mortgage,sell, lease, exchange or otherwise dispose of the same.\n\n10.All debts and liabilities of the foundation existingon the day preceding the day of commencement of the Actshall be paid by the Corporation hereby constituted and alldebts due to and subscriptions and contributions payable tothe Corporations on that day, shall be paid to the Corporationfor the purpose of this Act.\n\n11. The Seal of the Corporation shall not be affixed toany instrument whatsoever except in the presence of twomember of the Board of Management who shall sign theirnames to the instrument in token of their presence, and suchsigning shall be independent of the signing of any person asa witness."
