    "md5": "0d72b2e7335291db2b0cb5f570203d8d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1987,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Nimal Siripala de SilvaFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2012.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014\n\nIncorporationof the NimalSiripala deSilvaFoundation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n2Nimal Siripala de Silva Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(a)to give assistance, prizes and scholarships to needyschool children and youth to enable them tocontinue their education, assist them in theireducational, cultural and scientific activities andto establish permanent and mobile libraries;\n\n(b)to organize seminars, workshops, lectures,exhibitions, competitive tests and educational tourswith a view to promoting the educational activitiesof school children and youth and to holdcompetitions and training camps in order toimprove their sports skills and artistic skills and totake steps, including the award of prizes andcertificates and giving assistance for local or foreigntours to talented children;\n\n(c)to train persons for leadership and to utilize theyouth labour for the welfare of the public;\n\n(d)to take the necessary steps to promote artisticcreations, sports skills and technical knowledge ofschool leavers and to set up vocational trainingcenters as well as give them assistance to persuestudies in computer science and technology and toestablish institution to provide such study;\n\n(e)to assist by granting scholarships to studentsselected to universities and technical colleges andto establish self-employment opportunities forunemployed youth and to provide loans and toinaugurate various savings schemes;\n\n(f)to inaugurate and maintain pre-schools for earlychildhood development of the poor children,inaugurate and maintain classes in variouslanguages and various subjects for elders, schoolchildren, school leavers and provide them withother facilities;\n\n30"
  },
