    "chunk_text": "4. (1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject tothe other provisions of this Act and the rules in force for thetime being of the Corporation, be administered by a Board\n\n30\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation\n\n4Nimal Siripala de Silva Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(2) The first Board of Directors of the Corporation shallconsist of the members of the Board of Administration of theFoundation holding office on the day immediately precedingthe date of commencement of this Act.\n\n(3) A member of the Board of Directors other than theChairman shall unless he vacates his office earlier by deathor resignation, hold office for a period of four years. Wheredue to death or resignation a vacancy occurs in the Board ofDirectors, a new member shall be appointed to fill suchvcancy and such a new member shall hold office for a periodof four years.\n\n5. Subject to the Provisions of this Act, and any otherwritten Law, Corporation shall have the power to:-\n\n(a)acquire, hold or take any movable or immovableproperty for the Corporation or give on lease orhire, mortgage, pledge, sell, exchange or otherwisealienate, encumber or dispose of any immovableproperty of the Corporation.\n\n(b)enter into an perform or carry out whether directlyor through any officer or agent authorized in thatbehalf by the Corporation all such contracts oragreements as may be necessary for the attainmentof the objects or the exercise of the powers of theCorporation;\n\n(c)accept gifts, donations and bequests in cash or inkind;\n\nGeneralpowers of theCorporation.\n\n5Nimal Siripala de Silva Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(d)advance or lend and to borrow money for thepurpose of the Corporation in such manner and uponsuch security as the Corporation may think fit;\n\n(e)invest its funds, create and administer Trusst and tomaintain current, deposit and savings accounts inany Bank;"
