    "chunk_text": "3Victor Antony Educational, Social, EconomicServices and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(k)to initiate and implemente economic, social,cultural and environmental development activitiesin Sri Lanka and providing guidance necessary forit;\n\n(m)to design and implement social mobilizationprogrammes for the development of children andwomen and implementing education and trainingprogrammes for this purpose;\n\n(n)to initiate and implement technical, industrial andcomputer vocational training institutions andprogrammes so that young men and women fromfamilies of low social status can gain selfemployment opportunities;\n\n(o)to identify children of school going age who donot go to school for various reasons and directingthem towards admission to state schools orsupporting their education and social activities, andproviding social and economic support to familiesidentified as above;\n\n(p)to provide training necessary for young men andwomen engaged in agriculture and guiding themtowards export crops cultivation, organizing localand foreign marketing activities necessary for it,and providing space necessary for cultivation;\n\n(q)to provide assistance in times of natural anddisasters, emergencies and accidents;\n\n(r)to provide training in fields of engineering,technology, carpentry, driving and computing toyoung men and women who do not get access forhigher education and directing them towards suchvocations and starting training centres necessaryfor it;35\n\n4Victor Antony Educational, Social, EconomicServices and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(s)to initiate and maintain elders' homes for elders,care centres for disabled persons and children'shomes for helpless children and orphans, andproviding the assistance to such institutions thatare currently functioning amidst difficulties; and\n\n(t)to do all such other acts and things as are necessaryfor and incidental or conducive to the attainmentof the above objects."
