    "md5": "de864eb51d2c3813f525f80d966c56e5",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2003,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Victor AntonyEducational, Social, Economic Services and CharityFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2012.\n\nIncorporationof the VictorAntonyEducational,Social,EconomicServices andCharityFoundation.\n\nPreamble.\n\n2Victor Antony Educational, Social, EconomicServices and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be-\n\n(a)to provide medical aid and food to the poor, thedestitute and the sick \u2013\n\n(b)to conduct special services for needy school childrenand to offer assistance by way of scholarships,library facilities and other necessary support forstudents;\n\n(c)to conduct classes for the students sitting for yearFive scholarship, GCE (O/L) and GCE (A/L)examinations by experts in the particular field ofeducation;\n\n(d)to support and encourage the services provided bysenior citizens movements;\n\n(e)to develop religious places belonging to all thereligious ;\n\n(f)to organize seminars, workshop, lectures,exhibitions, and educational tours with a view topromoting the educational activities of schoolchildren;\n\n(g)to establish and maintain pre-school for earlychildhood development of the needy children;\n\n(h)to give aid by way of scholarships to any officer orservants engaged in the furtherance of the objectsof the Corporation;\n\n(i)to promote understanding, co-operation andfriendship with similar institutions within andoutside Sri Lanka;\n\n(j)to organize employees of small and medium scaleindustries and enterprises and working towards theirfuture advancement;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3Victor Antony Educational, Social, EconomicServices and Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(k)to initiate and implement economic, social,cultural and environmental development activitiesin Sri Lanka and providing guidance necessary forit;"
  },
