    "chunk_size_bytes": 1463,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of June 08, 2012\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 11. 06. 2012)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nSRI GUNARATHANA INTERNATIONALFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Sriyani Wijewickrama, for\n\nDigamadulla District\n\nto incorporate the Sri Gunarathana International Foundation\n\n1Sri Gunarathana International Foundation(Incorporation)\n\nal Foundation (Gaz)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI GUNARATHANA INTERNATIONALFOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the\u201cSri Gunarathana International Foundation\u201d has heretoforebeen formed in Sri Lanka for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out its objects and transacting all matters connectedwith the said Foundation according to the rules agreed to byits members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated, and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri GunarathanaInternational Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2012."
  },
