    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nBAREERAH MUSLIM LADIES ARABIC COLLEGE(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. M. S. Thawfeek, M. P. for Trincomalee Districton September 19, 2012\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nto incorporate the Bareerah Muslim Ladies Arabic College\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 182]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on August 06, 2012)\n\n2\u2014PL 005941\u2014850 (09/2012)\n\n1Bareerah Muslim Ladies Arabic College (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2\u2014PL 005837\u201475 (07/2012)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE BAREERAH MUSLIM LADIES ARABICCOLLEGE\n\nWHEREAS a college known as \"Bareerah Muslim LadiesArabic College\" has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka atMawathupola, Akurana-09, Kandy district for the purposeof effectually carrying out and transacting all objects andmatters connected with the said College, according to therules agreed to by the Board of management of the College.\n\nAND WHEREAS the said College has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for public advantage to grantsuch application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2013\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Bareerah Muslim LadiesArabic College (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2012."
  },
