    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. M. B. Farook, M.P. for Vanni Districton 10th April, 2013\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 234]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on January 28, 2013)\n\nDELTOTA MAHFALUL ULAMA ARABIC COLLEGE(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Deltota Mahfalul Ulama Arabic College\n\n2\u2014PL 007179\u2014850 (04/2013)\n\nDeltota Mahfalul Ulama Arabic College(Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 006835\u201475 (12/2012)\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE DELTOTA MAHFALUL ULAMA ARABICCOLLEGE\n\nWHEREAS an Arabic College called and known as the\u201cDeltota Mahfalul Ulama Arabic College\u201d has heretofore beenformed for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objectsand transacting all matters connected with the said ArabicCollege according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Arabic College has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be advantage to grant the saidapplication :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cDeltota Mahfalul UlamaArabic College (Incorporation)\u201d Act, No. of 2013."
  },
