    "chunk_text": "2\u2014PL 007047\u20141,600 (03/2013)\n\n25\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 6/2013.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MARRIAGE REGISTRATION ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 112)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n2.Section 24 of the Marriage Registration Ordinance(Chapter 112) (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended by the repeal of subsection(6) of that section, and the substitution therefor, of thefollowing subsection :\u2014\n\n\u201c(6) Every notice to a Registrar of a Division or to aDistrict Registrar as the case may be, under subsection(1), (2) or (3) of section 23 or every notice under subsection(4) thereof, shall be accompanied by a receipt issued bythe Registrar of such Division or such District Registraras the case may be, in proof of payment of a sum of rupeesten or a sum of rupees thirty respectively or such otheramount as may be prescribed by the Minister from time totime.\u201d.\n\n3.Section 27 of the principal enactment is herebyamemded by the repeal of subsection (4) of that section andthe substitution therefor, of the following subsection :\u2014\n\n\u201c(4) Where the declaration is made before the DistrictRegistrar, the party making the declaration shall pay rupeesone hundred or such amount as may be prescribed by theMinister from time to time and where the declaration ismade before the Registrar of a Division it shall beaccompanied by a receipt issued by the District Registrarin proof of payment of a sum of rupees one hundred orsuch amount as may be prescribed.\u201d.\n\nAmendmentof section 24of theMarriageRegistrationOrdinance(Chapter112).\n\nAmendmentof section 27of theprincipalenactment.\n\n30\n\nMarriage Registration (Amendment)2\n\n4.Section 34 of the principal enactment is herebyamended by the repeal of subsection (5) of that section andthe substitution therefor, of the following subsection :\u2014"
