    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 213]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Prime Minister and Minister of Buddha Sasana andReligious Affairs on 08th March, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on February 26, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 3.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nEXCISE (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52)\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 15 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) and thelegal effect of the section as amended is to grant exemption in respect of obtaining licensesfor the tapping and drawing of toddy from coconut trees.\n\n1Excise (Amendment)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 8/2013.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE EXCISE ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 52)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Excise (Amendment)Act, No. of 2013 and shall be deemed to have come intooperation from November, 08, 2012.\n\n2.Section 15 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) aslast amended by Act, No. 20 of 2011 is hereby furtheramended as follows :\u2014\n\n(1) in paragraph (b) thereof, by the substitution for thewords ''kithul tree and\" of the words ''kithul tree,coconut tree and\"; and\n\n(2) in paragraph (c) thereof, by the substitution for thewords ''kithul tree and\" of the words ''kithul tree,coconut tree and\".\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nAmendmentof Section 15of chapter52.\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.5\n\n10\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\n15\n\n2Excise (Amendment)"
