    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of April 12, 2013\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 16.04.2013)\n\nMINES AND MINERALS (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Mines and Minerals Act, No. 33 of 1992\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Environment andRenewable Energy\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5.\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends section 28 of the Mines and Minerals Act, No. 33 of1992 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of thesection as amended is to provide for the Minister to prescribe the minerals that are requiredfor construction purposes which requires a licence for transportation of the same.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends section 33 of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to prescribe reserved Minerals which requires theapproval of the Minister, to obtain a licence.\n\nClause 4 : This clause amends section 64 of the principal enactment and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to add two new paragraphs in respect of which theMinister may make regulations.\n\nMines and Minerals (Amendment)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 007136\u2014435 (03/2013)\n\n20\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 18/2012\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MINES AND MINERALSACT, NO. 33 OF 1992\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Mines and Minerals(Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.\n\n2.Section 28 of the Mines and Minerals Act, No. 33 of1992 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) ishereby amended by the addition of a new subsectionimmediately after subsection (4) as follows :\u2014"
