    "chunk_text": "3.(1) In the principal enactment and in any other writtenlaw there shall be substituted for the words \u201cthe WelfareSociety of the School for the Mentally Subnormal Child(Incorporation) Act\u201d of the words \u201cthe Chitra Lane WelfareSociety for Children with Special Needs Ordinance\u201d\n\n4. Clause 6(3) of the principal enactment is to beamended as follows :\u2014\n\n\u201cA vacancy in the Board of Trustees of the Corporationoccurring upon the death, resignation, incapacity orremoval of a Trustee from office, his/her successor\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof Long Titleof theprincipalenactmentNo. 75 of1988.\n\nGeneralamendmentsto theprincipalenactment.\n\nAmendmentof section 6of theprincipalenactment.\n\n25\n\n2Welfare Society of the School for the MentallySubnormal Child (Incorporation) (Amendment)\n\n5\n\nshall be appointed by the remaining Trustees fromamongst members of the Corporation who havecompleted not less than two years of membership.The maximum number of members in the Board ofTrustees shall be ten.\u201d\n\n5.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.Sinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nWelfare Society of the School for the MentallySubnormal Child (Incorporation) (Amendment)3\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
