    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nDENSRI EDUCATION FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 252]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Dilum Amunugama, M.P. for Kandy District on 20th June, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on April 29, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto incorporate the Densri Education Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs.6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n2\u2014PL 007361\u2014850 (06/2013)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n1Densri Education Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 007159\u2014 75 (04/2013)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE DENSRI EDUCATION FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cDensriEducation Foundation \u201d has been established in Sri Lankafor the purpose of effectually carrying out and transactingall objects and matters connected with the said Foundationaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Densri EducationFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.\n\n2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as are members of the \u201cDensriEducation Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted members of theCorporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetualsuccession under the name and style of \u201cDensri EducationFoundation\u201d, and by that name may sue and be sued in allcourts, with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and to alter the same at its pleasure."
  },
