    "chunk_size_bytes": 1994,
    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as are members of the \u201cDensriEducation Foundation\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted members of theCorporation hereby constituted, shall be a body corporate(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetualsuccession under the name and style of \u201cDensri EducationFoundation\u201d, and by that name may sue and be sued in allcourts, with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.\n\n(a)to initiate, maintain and uplift the educationalactivities, such as establishing pre-schools indifferent parts of the island, especially in rural andwar-affected areas for those who have no access topre-school education presently;\n\nIncorporationof the DensriEducationFoundation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n2Densri Education Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(b)to provide study materials, equipments anddeucation facilities for the law income families anddifferently abled children;\n\n(c)to assist schools and educational institutes in thefields of Sports and Information Technology;\n\n(d)to provide youth with opportunities for LeadershipTraining by organizing workshops, lectures,seminars, exhibitions, orientation programs, teachertraining programs in order to promote knowledgeas the most effective means to address the challengesof contemporary society;\n\n(e)to create facilities for Sinhalese to learn TamilLanguage and Tamils to learn Sinhalese and foreveryone to learn English, thus removingthe language barrier and promote betterunderstanding among different ethnic groups andlead them towards inter-cultural, inter-religious andinter-ethnic relationships;\n\n(f)to establish opportunities for Vocational Trainingand skills development;\n\n(g)to bring about a sustainable development bymaking an awareness in children on preservationof environment and cultivate a habit of plantingtrees;"
