    "chunk_size_bytes": 1612,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. (Mrs.) Chandrani Bandara Jayasinghe, M.P. forAnuradhapura District on 21st May, 2013\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 239]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on May 06, 2013)\n\nK. D. M. CHANDRA BANDARA COMMUNITYSERVICES FOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the K. D. M. Chandra Bandara Community ServicesFoundation\n\n2\u2014PL 007276\u2014850 (05/2013)\n\nK. D. M. Chandra Bandara Community ServicesFoundation (Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 007147\u201475 (04/2013)\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE K. D. M. CHANDRA BANDARACOMMUNITY SERVICES FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cK. D. M.Chandra Bandara Community Services Foundation\u201d hasheretofore been formed for the purpose of effectually carryingout its objects and matters connected with the said foundationaccording to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the K. D. M. Chandra BandaraCommunity Services Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No.of 2013."
  },
