    "chunk_size_bytes": 1576,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nJAMIAH RAHMANIYA ARABIC COLLEGE,AKURANA (INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 243]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Abdul Haleem , M.P. forKandy District on 05th June, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on May 13, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto incorporate the Jamiah Rahamaniya Arabic College, Akurana\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n2\u2014PL 007316\u2014850 (06/2013)\n\n1Jamiah Rahmaniya Arabic College, Akurana(Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 007151\u201475 (04/2013)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theJamiahRahmaniyaArabicCollege,Akurana.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE JAMIAH RAHMANIYA ARABICCOLLEGE, AKURANA\n\nWHEREAS an Association called and known as the \u201cJamiahRahmaniya Arabic College, Akurana\u201d has heretofore beenformed for the purpose of effectually carrying out andtransacting all objects and matters connected with the saidCollege according to the rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said College has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was formed and has applied to be incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant such application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Jamiah RahmaniyaArabic College, Akurana (Incorporation) Act, No. 2013."
  },
