    "chunk_size_bytes": 1789,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Jamiah RahmaniyaArabic College, Akurana (Incorporation) Act, No. 2013.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to administer the Jamiah Rahmaniya ArabicCollege, Akurana;\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n2Jamiah Rahmaniya Arabic College, Akurana(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to educate the daily use language of Sinhala,English, Tamil and Urudu;\n\n(c)to produce Islamic Ulama who are competent tolead the community under the Islamic Law on allspheres of life;\n\n(d)to produce \u201cHafils\u201d who have learnt the Holy Quranby heart;\n\n(e)establishing and exercising an Islamic economicsystem;\n\n(f)creating develop individuals who choose Islam ashis or her path of life;\n\n(g)to promote and foster unity within the Islamiccommunity and find solutions of problems of suchcommunity;\n\n(h)promoting Islamic Culture and arts and creatingthe necessary resources and maintain them; and\n\n(i)establishing a library and promoting towardseducation and research.\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to theother provisions of this Act and the rules in force for the timebeing of the Corporation be administered by a Board ofDirectors consisting of Chairman and Secretary, Treasurerand including eleven members elected in accordance withsuch rules.\n\n(2) The first Board of the Corporation shall consist of themembers of the Board of Administration of the Collegeholding office on the day immediately preceding the date ofCommencement of this Act.\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\n3Jamiah Rahmaniya Arabic College, Akurana(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
  },
