    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nBATTICALOA YOUNG MEN\u2019S CHRISTIAN\u2019SASSOCIATION (INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 247]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Pon. Selvarasa M. P. for Batticaloa Districton 06th June, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on May 27, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto incorporate the Batticaloa Young Men\u2019s Christian\u2019s Association\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n2\u2014PL 007330\u2014850 (06/2013)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n1Batticaloa Young Men\u2019s Christian\u2019sAssociation (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 007189\u2014 75 (04/2013)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE BATTICALOA YOUNG MEN\u2019SCHRISTIAN\u2019S ASSOCIATION\n\nWHEREAS a Association called and known as the \u201cYoungMen\u2019s Christian\u2019s Association of Batticaloa\u201d has heretoforebeen established at Batticalo for the purpose of achiving theseveral objects and effectually carring out and transactingall matters connected with the said association according tothe rules agreed to by its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantthe application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Batticaloa Young Men\u2019sChristian\u2019s Association (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013."
  },
  {
