    "chunk_size_bytes": 1647,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Batticaloa Young Men\u2019sChristian\u2019s Association (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted is declared to be the promotion of thespiritual,intellectual, social and physical welfare of all theChildren, Youth and general public of Batticaloa.\n\nIncorporationof the YoungMen\u2019sChristian\u2019sAssociationof Batticaloa.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n2Batticaloa Young Men\u2019s Christian\u2019sAssociation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts, matters and thingswhatsoever, as are necessary and desirable for the promotionor furtherance of the objects of the Corporation, or any oneof them, including the power to open, operate and closebank accounts, to borrow or raise money, with or withoutsecurity, to receive or collect grants and donations, to investits funds, and to engage, employ and dismiss officers andservants required for the carrying out of the objects of theCorporation.\n\n5.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall, subject to therules of the Corporation, be administered by a Board ofDirectors consisting of such number of members as may beprovided for rules made in that behalf and elected inaccordance therewith.\n\n(2) The first Board of Directors of the Corporation shallbe the members of the Board of Directors holding office onthe day immediately preceding the date of commencementof this Act."
  },
