    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 246]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Justice on 06th June, 2013\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nREGISTRATION OF ELECTORS(SPECIAL PROVISIONS)\n\nto make Special Provision to exempt internally displaced persons fromcertain requirements of the Registration of Electors Act, No. 44 of 1980; and to provide for matters connected therewith or incidental thereto.\n\n1Registration of Electors (Special Provisions)\n\n2\u2014PL 007295\u2014350 (06/2013)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 32/2013.\n\nAN ACT TO MAKE SPECIAL PROVISION TO EXEMPT INTERNALLY\n\nDISPLACED PERSONS FROM CERTAIN REQUIREMENTS OF THEREGISTRATION OF ELECTORS ACT, NO. 44 OF 1980; AND TO PROVIDE\n\nFOR MATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nWHEREAS certain persons have been internally displacedowing to the armed conflict which prevailed in Sri Lankaduring the recent past:\n\nAND WHEREAS the State has formulated a policy to enableinternally displaced persons and their children eligible tovote to exercise their right to franchise in the electoral districtin which their permanent places of residence were situatedprior to being internally displaced;\n\nAND WHEREAS it had now become necessary to make speciallegal provision in order to give effect to such policy:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Registration of Electors(Special Provisions) Act, No. of 2013.\n\n2.(1) Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in theRegistration of Electors Act, No. 44 of 1980, any citizen ofSri Lanka\u2014\n\n(a) who is an internally displaced person;\n\n(b) whose name appeared in the register of electors forany electoral district in the Northern Province orEastern Province for any year, until the end of theyear 2009; and"
  },
