    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 281]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Youth Affairs and Skills Developmenton 20th December, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on December 09, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 5. 00\n\n2-2d\n\nNATIONAL INSTITUTE OF BUSINESSMANAGEMENT (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the National Institute of Business ManagementLaw, No. 23 of 1976\n\n1National Institute of Business Management (Amendment)\n\n2\u2014PL 007742\u2014 425 (11/2013)\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 36/2012.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE NATIONAL INSTITUTE OF BUSINESSMANAGEMENT LAW, NO. 23 OF 1976\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the National Institute ofBusiness Management (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.\n\n2. Section 6 of the National Institute of BusinessManagement Law, No. 23 of 1976 is hereby amended insubsection (1) of that section, by the repeal of the paragraphs(a) and (b) thereof, and the substitution therefor, of thefollowing new paragraphs:\u2014\n\n\u201c(a)the following ex-officio members, namely _\n\n(i)the Director-General of the Instituteappointed under section 16;\n\n(ii)the President or Vice President of theFederation of Chambers of Commerce andIndustry of Sri Lanka;\n\n(iii)the President or Vice President of theNational Chamber of Commerce of Sri Lanka;\n\n(iv)the Director of the Postgraduate Institute ofManagement established under theUniversities Act, No. 16 of 1978;\n\n(v)Secretary to the Ministry of the Minister incharge of the subject of Technical andVocational Education and Training or SeniorOfficer nominated by the Secretary;\n\n(vi)a Senior Officer of Central Bank of Sri Lankanominated by the Governor of such Bank;\n\nAmendmentof section 6of the Law,No. 23 of1976\n\n2National Institute of Business Management (Amendment)\n\n5"
