    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. Achala Jagodage, M.P. on 05th November, 2013\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 275]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 28, 2013)\n\nINSTITUTE FOR RESEARCH AND DEVELOPMENT,SRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Institute for Research and Development, Sri Lanka\n\nInstitute for Research and Development, Sri Lanka(Incorporation)1\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 007616\u201475 (10/2013)\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE INSTITUTE FOR RESEARCH ANDDEVELOPMENT, SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS an Institute called and known as the\u201cInstitute for Research and Development\u201d has beenestablished in Sri Lanka in year 2000, and first registered asa Not for Profit Organization under the companies act in2004 (registration number N(A) 1170) and under the newamemdments to the act it was reregistered in 2011 as a Notfor Profit Professional Guarantee Limited Organization(registration number GA 635) under the name of Forum forResearch and Development for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and matters connectedwith the said institution according to the rules agreed to byits members. To fulfill the aspirations and expectations ofthe research community and the public in order to expandand extend research and related activities within the country.In addition to be accountable and transparent to the public:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said research Institute has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted objects and mattersfor which it was established, with regional and internationalacclaim and has applied to be incorporated, and it will be forthe public advantage to grant the application :\n\nBE it therefore, enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014"
  },
