    "chunk_size_bytes": 2008,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the The Federation ofPhotographic Societies of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act,No. of 2013.\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theFederation ofPhotographicSocieties ofSri Lanka.\n\nThe Federation of Photographic Societiesof Sri Lanka (Incorporation)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Federation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)to popularize the art of photography as an artisticand technical media;\n\n(b)to avail an oppoutunity in order to learn thephotographic art theoretically and practically freeof charge and to obtain any other professionalqualification in the field of photography;\n\n(c)to facilitate the school students to learn thephotographic art free of charge as an aestheticsubject;\n\n(d)to take action in order to keep the photographic artalive, and to safeguard the common rights of themembers of the societies;\n\n(e)to publish any useful publication under thesponsorship of the federation with the view ofpromoting the field;\n\n(f)to popularize the same among the photographicsocieties so established; and\n\n(g)to develope co-operation among the photographicsocieties internally and internationally in order toachieve the above objectivies; to educate how toprotect environment and to prepare for the future;and to develop co-operation and friendship amongthe societies.\n\n4.(1) The management, control and administration ofthe Corporation shall, subject to the provision of this Act,and the rules in force for the time being of the Corporation,vested in a Board of Directors (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cBoard\u201d) consisting of the office bearers and such otherpersons as may be provided for in such rules and elected inaccordance therewith.\n\n30\n\nManagementof the affairsof theCorporation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n3The Federation of Photographic Societiesof Sri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
