    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 279]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. M. S. Thowfeek, M. P.for Trincomalee District on 19th December, 2013\n\n(Published in the Gazette on December 09, 2013)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 5. 00\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nRIDHWANIYYAH ARABIC COLLEGE(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Ridhwaniyyah Arabic College\n\n1Ridhwaniyyah Arabic College (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 007820\u201475 (12/2013)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nIncorporationof theRidhwaniyyahArabicCollege\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE RIDHWANIYYAH ARABIC COLLEGE\n\nWHEREAS a college known as \u201cRidhwaniyyah ArabicCollege\u201d has heretofore been formed in Sri Lanka at No. 84,Kew Road, Colombo - 02 for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said college, according to the rulesagreed to by the Board of Management of the College:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said college has heretofore successfullycarried out and transacted the several objects and matters forwhich it was formed and has applied to be incorporated andit will be for the public advantage to grant such application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Ridhwaniyyah ArabicCollege (Incorporation) Act, No. 2013."
