    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of August 01, 2014\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 04.08.2014)\n\nPRADESHIYA SABHA (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Local Government andProvincial Councils\n\nto amend the Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No.15 of 1987\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 3.00Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause repeals the proviso to section 169 of Pradeshiya Sabha Act,No.15 of 1987 and the legal effect due to such repeal will be to revert back to the procedurefollowed by the Pradeshiya Sabha when re-submitting a budget or supplementary budget tothe Pradeshiya Sabha for further consideration.\n\n1Pradeshiya Sabha (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 03/2014.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PRADESHIYA SABHA ACT, NO. 15 OF 1987\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Pradeshiya Sabha(Amendment) Act, No. of 2014 and shall come into operationon such date as the Minister may appoint by Order Publishedin the Gazette.\n\n2.Section 169 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of1987 as amended by Local Authorities (Special Provisions)Act, No. 21 of 2012 is hereby further amended by the repealof the Proviso to that section.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.\n\nAmendmentof section169 of thePradeshiyaSabha Act,No. 15 of1987.\n\nSinhala textto prevail incase ofinconsistency.\n\nPradeshiya Sabha (Amendment)2\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), Payable to the SUPERINTENDENT, GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, DEPARTMENT OFGOVERNMENT INFORMATION, NO. 163, KIRULAPONA MAWATHA, POLHENGODA, COLOMBO 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
