    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Institute of Sport forPeace, Education, Empowerment and Development(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\nIncorporationofthe InstituteSport forPeace,Education,EmpowermentandDevelopment(SPEED).\n\n2 Institute of Sport for Peace, Education,Empowerment and Development (SPEED) (Incorporation)\n\nPL 00713PL 007134 Kandy Dharmaraja College4 KandyDharmaraja College\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(2) The Corporation shall be deemed to be a voluntarysocial service organization within the meaning, and for thepurpose of the Voluntary Social Services Organizations(Registration and Supervision) Act, No. 31 of 1980 and theprovisions of that Act shall apply to and in relation to themanagement of the affairs of the Corporation.\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014\n\n(a)to increase performance of Sri Lanka and SouthAsian nations in International sporting events byestablishing a platform for the upholding ofprinciples and values of Olympism and to supportOlympic movement;\n\n(b)to optimize the potential of sport for contributingto national and regional peace building and conflictprevention and to achieve internationally agreeddevelopment goals by using sport as a tool for peaceeducation and social integration under Sport forDevelopment and Peace;\n\n(c)to promote professional, traditional and recreationalsport in Sri Lanka through creating access toresources, services and facilities;\n\n(d)to promote gender equality and the empowermentof women through suporting their career andadvancement in sport, in particular their progressivehigh performance in international sporting events;\n\n(e)to advance the use of sport as a vehicle to promotehealth and prevent drug abuse through physicaleducation, foster the inclusion and well-being ofpersons with disabilities and facilitate socialinclusion of marginalized groups;"
