    "chunk_text": "Clause 6 : This clause amends the First Schedule to the principal enactment and thelegal effect of the said Schedule as amended is to revise the present criteria of exemptionrelating to certain articles.\n\nClause 7 : This clause specify dates on which certain provisions come into force.\n\n1Nation Building Tax (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nShort titleand date ofoperation.\n\n2\u2014PL 008879\u2014450 (03/2015)\n\n25\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 14/2015\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE NATION BUILDING TAXACT, NO. 9 OF 2009\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-\n\n1.(1) This Act may be cited as the Nation Building Tax(Amendment) Act, No\u2026.. of 2015, and shall be deemed tohave come into operation from January 1, 2015, unlessdifferent dates of operation are specified hereunder.\n\n(2) The provisions of section 6B shall come intooperation on such date as the Minister may appoint by Orderpublished in the Gazette.\n\n2.Section 3 of the Nation Building Tax Act, No. 9 of2009 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d)as last amended by Act, No. 10 of 2014 is hereby furtheramended as follows:-\n\n(1)in subsection (2) of that section \u2013\n\n(a)in paragraph (iii) thereof by the repeal of thefirst proviso and substitution therefor of thefollowing:-\n\n\u201dProvided that, the liable turnover from thesupply of any financial service in Sri Lanka,by any person carrying on the business ofproviding financial services shall,notwithstanding anything to the contrary inany other provisions of this Act, be \u2013\n\n(a)for any quarter ending on or beforeSeptember 30, 2014 and the periodcommencing on October 1, 2014 andending on October 24, 2014, the value\n\nAmendmentof section 3of Act, No. 9of 2009.\n\nNation Building Tax (Amendment)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
