    "chunk_size_bytes": 1972,
    "chunk_text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the \u201cArundika FernandoRelief Services and Godfrey Fernando MemorialFoundation\u201d (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\nIncorporationof theArundikaFernandoReliefServices andGodfreyFernandoMemorialFoundation.\n\n2Arundika Fernando Relief Services and GodfreyFernando Memorial Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a)assisting the poverty stricken elders and personswith physical and mental disabilities to get rid oftheir sufferings and to help them lead a better life;\n\n(b)assisting the students who find it difficult to pursuetheir education owing to poverty of their parentsbeing disabled, in whatever manner, providingscholarships and financial grants;\n\n(c)supporting the establisment of pre-school andmaking arrangements to ensure upliftment ofchildren by devising programmes to develop them;\n\n(d)assisting and aiding the development of libraryfacilities and organizing expert lectures andworkshops with a view to promoting educationamong students;\n\n(e)introducing technical expertise and skills requiredto successfully run industries related to fisheries,agriculture and commercial business, organizingtraining workshops, providing financial assistanceto whatever possible manner and making availablevarious facilities connected thereto;\n\n(f)identifying local artists in order to preservetraditional cultural arts and conducting assessmentof them at various levels to encourage them andmaking arrangements to obtain their maximumcontribution towards the preservation of traditionalcultural arts by offering them various facilitiesrequired by them;\n\n(g)effecting betterment of the lives of farmers andfishermen by promoting small and medium levelindustries and expanding infrastructure facilities;\n\n30\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation."
  },
