    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of the\u201cRavichandra Foundation\u201d or shall hereafter be admitted asmembers of the Corporation hereby constituted, shall be abody corporate with perpetual succession, under the nameand style of the \u201cRavichandra Foundation\u201d (hereinafterreferred to as \u201cthe Corporation\u201d) and by that name may sue,and be sued in all courts, with full power and authority tohave and use a common seal and alter the same at its pleasure.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\nIncorporationof theRavichandraFoundation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\nRavichandra Foundation(Incorporation)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to assist the relevant authorities that promotecreation and protection of innovative products byfurthering 3.(a) above and in generating of selfemployment;\n\n(c)to assist the relevant authorities to create businessopportunities to market products that protect andpromote our culture, secure a reasonable price fortheir products and protect their professions;\n\n(d)to assist the relevant authorities to protect nationalarts and culture for posterity and creating businessopportunities for the sale of such products;\n\n(e)to promote economic development by assisting therelevant authorities to implement agriculturalprojects such as promotion of usage of organicfertilizer;\n\n(f)to assist the relevant authorities in providing reliefto those affected by natural disasters;\n\n(g)to assist the relevant authorities in the private,public and NGO sector to uplift educational, healthand economic standards of the underprivilegedpersons in the nation;\n\n(h)to assist the relevant authorities to provide financialand other assistance to underprivileged students;\n\n(i)to assist the relevant authorities to establish and ormaintain vocational/technical educationalinstitutes for underprivileged students and assistthem to complete the courses;"
