    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the commencement of this Act, suchand so many persons as presently are members of the CasimiFoundation (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cFoundation\u201d) orshall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporationhereby constituted, shall be a body corporate (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual successionunder the name and style of the \u201cCasimi Foundation\u201d andby that name may sue and be sued in all courts with fullpower and authority to have and use a common seal and toalter the same at its pleasure.\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\nIncorporationof the CasimiFoundation.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\nCasimi Foundation (Incorporation)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(b)to arrange special preparation programes forGCE (O/L) and GCE (A/L) students and Grade 5students;\n\n(c)to conduct workshops and discussions to trainteachers of Dhamma Schools and pre-schools;\n\n(d)to provide instruments, equipments ect. for fishingand agriculture;\n\n(e)to induce youths towords traditional games of thecountry and to find career development for them;\n\n(f)to give opportunity and priority to the womencommunity in all sectors;\n\n(g)to create, facilitate and provide training on selfemployment projects for women;\n\n(h)to provide legal facilities and assistance ondiscrimintaion for women of getting their equalrights;\n\n(i)to respect and provide priority services to the seniorcitizens and war heroes;\n\n(j)to safeguard and make awareness on child rights;and\n\n(k)to provide all necessary facilities for theachievement of all or any of the above objects.\n\n4.Subject to the provision of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power\u2014\n\n(a)to purchase, acquire, rent, construct or otherwiseobtain lands or buildings which may be requiredfor the purpose of the Corporation;\n\nPowers of theCorporationto acquireproperty,invest funds,and raiseloans etc..\n\n3Casimi Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
