    "chunk_text": "(2)The founder member of the Foundation, HolinessMohamed Seyyad Buhary Nalla Koya Thangalshall he the Chairman of the Board of Directors forlife and thereafter, the family succsessors to himshall become the next Chairman of the Board ofDirectors;\n\n(a)the classification of membership and the admission,subscription and fees payable, expulsion orresignation;\n\n(b)the term of office of the Board of Governors theresignation or removal from officer of suchmembers, the filling of vacancies and election ofsuch members;\n\n(c)the procedure to be followed at the meetings of theBoard, Annual General Meetings, the summoningand the quorum of such meetings and conduct ofthe business thereat;\n\n(d)the powers, conduct duties and functions of variousofficers, agents and servants of the Corporationincluding their terms and conditions of service;\n\n(e)the administration and management of assets,properties of the Foundation and custody of funds;and\n\n(f)such other things as may be necessary for theattainment of the object of the Foundation.\n\n(2) Any rule made by the Foundation may be amended,or rescinded in like manner, as a rule made under subsection (1).\n\nRules of theCorporation.\n\n30\n\n5Seyyed Sheikh Koya Thangal Mowlana Foundation(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(3) All members of the Foundation shall be subject tothe rules in force for the time being of the Foundation.\n\n7.(1) The Corporation shall have tis own fund andmoneys received by the Fund of the way of testamentarydispositions, transfers, donations shall be deposited in thename of the Corporation in one or more banks as the LifePatrons shall determine.\n\n(2) All expenses borne by the Corporation in the exerciseand discharge of power and functions of the Corporationshall be paid out from the fund.\n\n8.(1) The Board of Directors of the Corporation shallcause proper account to be kept of all moneys received andexpended by the Corporation."
