    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 23]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Dilum Amunugama, M. P. for Kandy Districton 24th November, 2015\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 09, 2015)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nKANDY SRI PUSHPADANA SOCIETY LTD.\n\n(INCORPORATION)\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nto incorporate the Kandy Sri Pushpadana Society Ltd.\n\n2\u2014PL 009430\u2014 225 (11/2015)\n\n1Kandy Sri Pushpadana Society Ltd.(Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 009312\u2014300 (10/2015)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 6/2006.\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE KANDY SRI PUSHPADANA SOCIETY LTD.\n\nWHEREAS as a Society known as \u201cthe Kandy SriPushpadana Society Ltd\u201d had been established so far for thepurpose of implementing all its objectives and matters asagreed upon according to the regulation, by the said Societyand its members:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Society has so for successfullyimplemented the said objectives and matters for which itwas established, and an application has been made toincorporate the said society and it will be for the publicadvantage to grant such application:\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kandy Sri PushpadanaSociety Ltd. (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many person as now are members of theKandy Sri Pushpadana Society Ltd. (hereinafter referred toas the \u201cOrganisation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admittedmembers of the Corporation hereby constituted, shall be abody corporate (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d)with perpetual succession under the name and style of the\u201cKandy Sri Pushpadana Society Ltd.\u201d and by that namemay sue and be sued, in all courts with full power andauthority to have and use a common seal and to alter thesame at its pleasure."
