    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of November 27, 2015\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 30. 11. 2015)\n\nKOTASARA PIYANGALA RAJAMAHA VIHARASTHADEVELOPMENT SOCIETY (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto incorporate the Kotasara Piyangala Rajamaha ViharasthaDevelopment Society\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. Nalin Bandara JayamahaM. P. for Kurunegala District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Kotasara Piyangala Rajamaha ViharasthaDevelopment Society (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 009417\u2014 300 (11/2015)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE KOTASARA PIYANGALA RAJAMAHAVIHARASTHA DEVELOPMENT SOCIETY\n\nWHEREAS a Foundation called and known as the \u201cKotasaraPiyangala Rajamaha Viharastha Development Society\u201d hasheretofore been established in Sri Lanka for the purpose ofeffectually carrying out and transacting all objects andmatters connected with the said Foundation according tothe rules agreed to by its members.\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the application.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kotasara PiyangalaRajamaha Viharastha Development Society (Incorporation)Act, No. of 2015."
  },
