    "chunk_text": "(h)to present the Buddhist point of view on any matter,on behalf of the Buddist community at conferencesand seminars on global problems relating toeducation culture, communications survival,development and peace, convened by anyinternational, governmental or non-governmentalorganizations, whether religious or secular ;\n\n35\n\n3Kotasara Piyangala Rajamaha ViharasthaDevelopment Society (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n(i)to initiate, co-ordinate and assist studies on problemsof survival, development, peace, education andculture, from a Buddhist perspective and publishthe results of such studies;\n\n(j)to provide facilities for Buddhist leaders and scholarsof the world to meet and discuss ; and\n\n(k)to function as a documentation Centre for peaceoriented Buddhist Study groups meditation groups,mass-media groups and action groups and to providefor the exchange of information and the sharing ofexperiences ;\n\n4.(1) The affairs of the Corporatoin shall, subject tothe rules in force for the time being of the Corporation, beadministered by a Committee of Management consisting ofthe Director-General, the Honorary Secretary and theHonorary Treasurer and not less than six other members asmay be provided for in those rules and elected in accordancetherewith.\n\n(2) The member of the Foundation Chief IncumbentKotasara Piyangala Rajamaha Vihara (Ven.) SriNandiramadhipathi Badulla Gammana Gunarathana Thero,shall be the Chairman of the Board of Directors for life. TheChairman shall be the Chief Executive Officer of theCorporation.\n\n(3) The first Committee of Management of theCorporation shall consist of the member of the Committee ofManagement of the Foundation holding office on the daypreceding the date of commencement of this Act, and whosenames are specified in the Schedule to this Act."
