    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nSUSANTHA PUNCHINILAME FOUNDATION(INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. Lakshman Ananda Wijemanne M. P. forKalutara District on 01st December, 2015\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nto incorporate the Susantha Punchinilame Foundation\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 27]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 16, 2015)\n\n2\u2014PL 009483\u2014225 (12/2015)\n\n1Susantha Punchinilame Foundation(Incorporation)\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SUSANTHA PUNCHINILAME FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS an Association call and known as the \u201cSusanthaPunchinilame Foundation\u201d has heretofore been formed atMagossa Terrace, Peduru Kotuwa, Trincomalee, inTrincomalee District the purpose of effectually carrying outand transacting all objects and matters connected with thesaid Foundation according to the rules agreed to by itsmembers :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated, and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Susantha PunchinilameFoundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2015."
  },
