    "chunk_size_bytes": 1841,
    "chunk_text": "2.From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so many persons as now are members of theDaya Sarana Development Foundation (hereinafter referredto as \u201cthe Foundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted asnow are members of the Corporation hereby constituted,shall be a body corporate (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cCorporation\u201d) with perpetual succession under the nameand style of the \u201cDaya Sarana Development Foundation\u201d,and by that name may sue and be sued in all courts, with fullpower and authority to have and use a common seal and toalter the same at its pleasure.\n\n2Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPL 007773 Daya Sarana (G)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be:\u2014\n\n(a)to promote religious harmony, mutualunderstanding, spiritual development , goodwilland friendship among the youth in the area throughreligious , cultural, educational and economicinteraction;\n\n(b)to protect, support and ensure welfare, interests,safety, integrity and status of people in the area andto safeguard their rights and privileges;\n\n(c)to provide for the physical welfare and personaldevelopment of teenagers through youthdevelopment centers including gumasiums;\n\n(d)to provide additional educational support by givingnecessary training in various fields which willenhance their personal qualification levels in orderto meet the competition and necessary requirementsin finding employment;\n\n(e)to hold and conduct periodical technical trainingcamps for the youth to develop their skills with theultimate aim of projecting them towards findingsuitable employment;\n\n(f)to establish carpentry and masonry and any othersuitable vocational training school in central townsand the like with a view to educate and train youthfor a vocation;"
  },
