    "chunk_text": "(m)to aid and assist youth to commence and operatecottage industries for self employment with a viewto uplift their living standards;\n\n(n) to provide agricultural equipment/machinery foryouth to develop and facilitate agricultural andindustrial project in the area.\n\n(a) to procure the Corporation to be registered,incorporated or otherwise empowered or representedor to open liaison offices in any country or placeoutside the Democratic Socialist Republic ofSri Lanka;\n\n30\n\nGeneralPowers of theCorporation.\n\n4Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPL 007773 Daya Sarana (G)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(b) to receive or collect grant, gifts, donations, subsidies,endowments and subscriptions whether in cash orin material from donors in Sri Lanka or elsewhere;\n\n(c) to collect necessary funds for the achievement ofthe objectives from well wishers by way ofdonations, variety shows, Non-GovernmentalOrganizations and by other means;\n\n(d) to take responsible, just and legitimate steps toremove obstacles to the attainment of the aboveobjects;\n\n(e) to purchase, take on lease or exchange, hire orotherwise acquire any movable property and anyrights, privileges necessary or expendient forpromotion of the objects of the Corporation and toconstruct, maintain and alter any buildings orerections required for the work of the Corporation;\n\n(f) to receive, purchase, sell or acquire all forms ofproperties both movable or immovable, shares incommercial, industrial and banking enterprises andto accept property bequeathed by deed, last will orcodicil;\n\n(g) to collaborate with, assist and receive assistance fromother persons and or organizations engaged insimilar activities, whether in Sri Lanka or elsewhere;\n\n(h) to maintain liaison and affiliation with other relatedorganizations and to enter into agreement withpersons or organizations in Sri Lanka or elsewherein pursuance of the vision and objectives of theCorporation;"
