    "chunk_text": "(h) to maintain liaison and affiliation with other relatedorganizations and to enter into agreement withpersons or organizations in Sri Lanka or elsewherein pursuance of the vision and objectives of theCorporation;\n\n5Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(j) to open and maintain current, saving and depositaccounts with any bank or other similar institutions;\n\n(k) to borrow moneys for the purpose of the Corporationon such terms and conditions and with or withoutsecurity as may be determined from time to time;\n\n(l) to make, repeal, alter or amend Rules andRegulations defining the manner of managementof the corporation and all necessary-by-laws orordinance for the regulations and conduct of itsaffairs and the various branches of its activities;\n\n(m) in general to undertake such other lawful thingsfrom time to time as are incidental or conductiveand shall be deemed necessary for the promotion ofthe ideas and object of the Corporation;\n\n(n) to invest the moneys of the Corporation notimmediately required for its purposes in or uponsuch investments, securities or property as may bethought fit subject nevertheless to such conditionsas may for the time being be imposed or requiredby law;\n\n(o) to make, draw, accept, discount, negotiate, buy, selland issue bills of exchange, cheques, promissorynotes and other negotiable or transferableinstruments or securities;\n\n(p) to do all such other acts and things as may benecessary incidental or beneficial to fulfill andaccomplish the objects of the Corporation.\n\n5.(1) The management of the affairs of the Corporationshall be managed by a Committee of Management consistingof number of members not exceeding fifteen. It shall have aPresident, Vice President, administrative Secretary, Treasurerand such Officers and staff to perform such duties as theCorporation may determine.\n\nManagementof theactivities oftheCorporation.\n\n6Daya Sarana Development Foundation (Incorporation)\n\nPL 007773 Daya Sarana (G)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30"
