    "chunk_size_bytes": 2021,
    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of December 04, 2015\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 07. 12. 2015)\n\nFISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCES(AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nTo be presented in Parliament by Hon. M. A. Sumanthiran, M. P.for Jaffna District\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nto amend the Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Act, No. 2 of 1996\n\n(Private Member\u2019s Bill)\n\n1Fisheries and Aquatic Resources (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE FISHERIES AND AQUATIC RESOURCESACT, NO. 2 OF 1996\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Fisheries and AquaticResources (Amendment) Act, No. of 2016.\n\n2.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 28 of the Fisheries and AquaticResources Act, No. 2 of 1996 (hereinafter referred to as the\u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and shall have effect as section28A of that enactment.\n\n28A. (1) No person shall engage in or causeany other person to engage in fishingoperations carried out by Trawl Nets, includingthose using nets without two wings but usingvertical poles at the two free ends of the net.\n\n(2) No person shall use, posses, import,transport, purchase or sell Trawl Nets for thepurpose of carrying out trawling operations inSri Lanka waters.\n\n(3) No license shall be issued under Part IIof the principal enactment for fishingoperations carried out by Trawl Nets inSri Lanka waters.\n\n(4) Any license, which has already beenissued under the principal enactment forfishing operations carried out by Trawl Nets inSri Lanka waters, shall not be renewed, and\n\nShort title.\n\nInsertion ofnew section28A to theprincipalenactment.\n\n\u201cProhibitionof TrawlingOperations.\n\nFisheries and Aquatic Resources (Amendment)2\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\napplications for the renewal of such a licenseshall not be entertained:"
