    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of November 06, 2015\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 09. 11. 2015)\n\nCODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDURE (AMENDMENT)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nto amend the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15 of 1979\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Justice\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 135 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act, No. 15of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) by including section 291c ofthe Penal Code in paragraph (e) of subsection (1) thereof, and the legal effect of the sectionas amended is to make the Attorney General\u2019s sanction a pre-requisite to take cognizance ofan offence punishable under section 291C.\n\nClause 3 : This clause amends the First Schedule to the principal enactment and makesan amendment consequential to the amendment made by clause 2.\n\n1Code of Criminal Procedure(Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n2\u2014PL 009336\u2014425 (10/2015)\n\nShort title.\n\nL. D.\u2014O. 40/2015.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE CODE OF CRIMINAL PROCEDUREACT, NO. 15 OF 1979\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Code of CriminalProcedure (Amendment) Act, No. of 2015.\n\n2.Section 135 of the Code of Criminal Procedure Act,No. 15 of 1979 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) is hereby amended in paragraph (e) of subsection(1) of that section, by the substitution for the words andfigures \u201cany offence punishable under section 290A orsection 291B of the Penal Code\u201d, of the words and figures\u201cany offence punishable under section 290A , 291B or 291Cof the Penal Code\u201d.\n\n3.The First Schedule to the principal enactment is herebyamended by the insertion immediately after the entries relatingto section 291B of the following new entries:\u2014\n\nAmendmentof section135 of Act,No. 15 of1979."
  },
